---

<DocsLayout
  title="Loomey"
  description="Import and read EPUB books, join buddy reads, sprint with other readers, complete challenges, track goals, preserve streaks, and discover your reading DNA."
>
  <main class="loomey-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-one"></div>
      <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-two"></div>

      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet Loomey</p>
        <h1>Your books, your people, and your entire reading life in one place.</h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          Loomey is a deeply social reading companion with a full book catalog,
          personal library, EPUB reader, goals, challenges, reading sprints,
          buddy reads, history, streak protection, statistics, and a reader
          profile that turns everything you do into a story worth looking back on.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Loomey links">
          <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="#features">Explore Features</a>
          <a class="secondary-button raised-button" href="/contact">Contact Support</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-showcase reveal reveal-delay">
        <div class="showcase-card main-card">
          <span class="mini-label">Today in Loomey</span>
          <h4>Read together. Grow together.</h4>
          <div class="progress-line"><span></span></div>
          <div class="showcase-stats">
            <span><b>42</b> day streak</span>
            <span><b>1,284</b> pages</span>
            <span><b>18</b> sprints</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-one">
          <span>Featured Challenge</span>
          <strong>Read Somewhere New</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-two">
          <span>Live Activity</span>
          <strong>Reading Timer Running</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <GradientDivider />

    <section class="intro-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">More Than a Book Tracker</p>
      <h2>The reading app that actually understands readers.</h2>
      <p>
        Loomey does not stop at logging books. It gives you a place to read,
        connect, compete, reflect, set ambitious goals, and understand the shape
        of your reading life over time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="loomey-gallery-section reveal" aria-labelledby="loomey-gallery-title">
      <div class="section-heading gallery-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Inside Loomey</p>
        <h2 id="loomey-gallery-title">Swipe through the reading experience</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="loomey-gallery" data-loomey-gallery>
        <button
          class="gallery-button gallery-button-left"
          type="button"
          aria-label="Previous Loomey screenshot"
          data-gallery-previous
        >
          <img src="/img/icons/right.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
        </button>

        <div class="gallery-track-container">
          <div class="gallery-track" data-gallery-track>
            {
              loomeyGalleryImages.map((image, index) => (
                <figure class:list={["gallery-slide", { "is-active": index === 0 }]}>
                  <img
                    src={image.src}
                    alt={image.alt}
                    loading={index === 0 ? "eager" : "lazy"}
                    decoding="async"
                  />
                </figure>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>

        <button
          class="gallery-button gallery-button-right"
          type="button"
          aria-label="Next Loomey screenshot"
          data-gallery-next
        >
          <img src="/img/icons/right.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
        </button>

        <div class="gallery-meta" aria-live="polite">
          <span data-gallery-count>1 / {loomeyGalleryImages.length}</span>
          <div class="gallery-progress" aria-hidden="true">
            <span data-gallery-progress></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-grid" id="features" aria-label="Loomey features">
      <article class="feature-card wide reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Library & Reader</p>
        <h3>Build a beautiful library and read inside the app</h3>
        <p>
          Browse the book catalog, import your own books, organize and sort your
          collection, and open EPUB files in Loomey’s built-in reader. Your
          library works like a true personal bookshelf rather than a simple list.
        </p>
        <div class="chip-row">
          <span>Book Catalog</span><span>Imports</span><span>EPUB Reader</span><span>Sorting</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Buddy Reads</p>
        <h3>Find your next reading partner</h3>
        <p>
          Post a buddy-read announcement globally, let other readers discover it,
          and review requests from people who want to join you.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Reading Sprints</p>
        <h3>Turn focused reading into a shared event</h3>
        <p>
          Start a sprint from chat by entering your starting page and duration.
          Track all-time sprint progress, compare results on the leaderboard, and
          view your own mini sprint profile.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Daily Challenges</p>
        <h3>There is always something new to try</h3>
        <p>
          A rotating challenge becomes the featured challenge each day, giving
          readers a fresh reason to open the app, participate, and keep reading.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Social Reading</p>
        <h3>A global feed built around books</h3>
        <p>
          Share challenge updates or anything book-related with the entire Loomey
          community. Like posts, comment, reply to comments, and continue
          conversations through nested replies.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card wide reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Goals & Progress</p>
        <h3>Create almost any reading goal you can imagine</h3>
        <p>
          Track progress through reading sessions with starting pages, ending
          pages, minutes read, linked books, linked goals, and earned points. For
          goals that do not fit a session, use a dedicated Goal Check-In instead.
        </p>
        <div class="goal-preview">
          <div><span>Current Progress</span><strong>184 / 300 pages</strong></div>
          <div class="goal-bar"><span></span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="spotlight reveal">
      <div class="spotlight-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Always With You</p>
        <h2>A reading timer that follows you outside the app</h2>
        <p>
          Start a reading timer in Loomey and keep it visible through Dynamic
          Island and Live Activities while you use other apps. Completed reading
          time earns points and becomes part of your reading record.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="timer-demo" aria-label="Reading timer preview">
        <span class="timer-pill">Loomey Reading</span>
        <h4>00:42:18</h4>
        <span>Atomic Habits · Session Active</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="details-section reveal">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Everything Else</p>
        <h2>Open each chapter of the Loomey experience</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="details-list">
        <details open>
          <summary>
            <span><b>Reading History</b><small>Revisit any day of your reading life</small></span>
          </summary>
          <p>
            Explore a timeline of your reading activity, tap any day to see what
            happened, and move backward or forward from week to week.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span><b>Stats, Streaks & Breaks</b><small>Protect momentum without punishing real life</small></span>
          </summary>
          <p>
            Pause active reading to preserve your streak when you need a break,
            then resume when you are ready. View your heat map, milestones,
            streaks, logged sessions, and goal check-ins from one place.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span><b>Reader Profile</b><small>See what makes your reading life yours</small></span>
          </summary>
          <p>
            Your profile brings together personal reading highlights, Reading
            DNA, all-time achievements, and a Year Wrapped experience built from
            the books, sessions, goals, and communities that shaped your year.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="community-banner reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Built for Readers</p>
        <h2>Reading can be personal without being lonely</h2>
        <p>
          Loomey gives solo readers the tools to stay motivated and social readers
          the space to meet, sprint, challenge one another, and celebrate progress.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="/github">Join the Community</a>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Explore Loomey</p>
      <h2>Your next chapter deserves a better companion</h2>
      <p>
        Learn more about the app, report a problem, share an idea, or reach out
        directly through the Vox Apps support hub.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-grid">
        <a href="https://github.com/asteriasmoons/loomey/issues/1#issue-4929068249" class="cta-card">
          <span class="cta-kicker">Report an Issue</span>
          <h2>Loomey Bug Reports</h2>
          <span class="cta-button">Open Reports</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/github" class="cta-card">
          <span class="cta-kicker">Ideas & Discussions</span>
          <h2>Vox Apps on GitHub</h2>
          <span class="cta-button">Open GitHub</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="cta-card">
          <span class="cta-kicker">Need Help?</span>
          <h2>Contact Support</h2>
          <span class="cta-button">Get Support</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</DocsLayout>

<script>
  const revealItems = document.querySelectorAll(".reveal");

  const revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add("is-visible");
          revealObserver.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    },
    { threshold: 0.12 }
  );

  revealItems.forEach((item) => revealObserver.observe(item));

  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-loomey-gallery]").forEach((gallery) => {
    const track = gallery.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-track]");
    const slides = Array.from(gallery.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".gallery-slide"));
    const previousButton = gallery.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-gallery-previous]");
    const nextButton = gallery.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-gallery-next]");
    const count = gallery.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-count]");
    const progress = gallery.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-progress]");

    if (!track || !slides.length || !previousButton || !nextButton) return;

    let currentIndex = 0;
    let autoplay: number | undefined;
    let dragStartX = 0;

    const updateGallery = () => {
      track.style.transform = `translateX(-${currentIndex * 100}%)`;

      slides.forEach((slide, index) => {
        slide.classList.toggle("is-active", index === currentIndex);
      });

      if (count) count.textContent = `${currentIndex + 1} / ${slides.length}`;
      if (progress) progress.style.width = `${((currentIndex + 1) / slides.length) * 100}%`;
    };

    const showSlide = (index: number) => {
      currentIndex = (index + slides.length) % slides.length;
      updateGallery();
    };

    const startAutoplay = () => {
      window.clearInterval(autoplay);
      autoplay = window.setInterval(() => showSlide(currentIndex + 1), 4200);
    };

    const stopAutoplay = () => window.clearInterval(autoplay);

    nextButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
      showSlide(currentIndex + 1);
      startAutoplay();
    });

    previousButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
      showSlide(currentIndex - 1);
      startAutoplay();
    });

    gallery.addEventListener("pointerdown", (event) => {
      dragStartX = event.clientX;
      stopAutoplay();
    });

    gallery.addEventListener("pointerup", (event) => {
      const deltaX = event.clientX - dragStartX;

      if (Math.abs(deltaX) > 40) {
        showSlide(currentIndex + (deltaX < 0 ? 1 : -1));
      }

      startAutoplay();
    });

    gallery.addEventListener("mouseenter", stopAutoplay);
    gallery.addEventListener("mouseleave", startAutoplay);
    gallery.addEventListener("focusin", stopAutoplay);
    gallery.addEventListener("focusout", startAutoplay);
    window.addEventListener("resize", updateGallery);

    updateGallery();
    startAutoplay();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .loomey-page {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1rem 0 5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(310px, 0.8fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    min-height: 620px;
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .hero-copy,
  .hero-showcase {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .card-kicker,
  .mini-label {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .hero-text,
  .intro-section p,
  .spotlight p,
  .community-banner p,
  .cta-section > p {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .primary-button,
  .secondary-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 50px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
  }

  .primary-button { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #03dbfc, #7d19f7 55%, #e019d4); }
  .secondary-button { background: rgba(255,255,255,.055); backdrop-filter: blur(18px); }
  .primary-button:hover, .secondary-button:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.35); }

  .hero-showcase { min-height: 410px; }

  .showcase-card,
  .floating-card,
  .feature-card,
  .timer-demo,
  .details-list details,
  .community-banner,
  .cta-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,.085), rgba(255,255,255,.025));
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.22), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    backdrop-filter: blur(22px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(22px);
  }

  .main-card {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 55px 20px 55px 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 30px;
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }

  .main-card h4 {
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .progress-line { height: 10px; margin: 1.75rem 0; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); overflow: hidden; }
  .progress-line span { display: block; width: 72%; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: var(--gradient-heading); animation: pulse-width 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .showcase-stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .showcase-stats b { color: #fff; }

  .floating-card { position: absolute; z-index: 3; padding: 1rem 1.15rem; border-radius: 18px; animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .floating-card span { display: block; font-size: .72rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .floating-card strong { font-size: .92rem; }
  .floating-card-one { top: 0; right: 0; }
  .floating-card-two { bottom: 8px; left: 0; animation-delay: -2.4s; }

  .hero-glow { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(90px); opacity: .28; pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-glow-one { width: 360px; height: 360px; right: 4%; top: 5%; background: #7d19f7; }
  .hero-glow-two { width: 280px; height: 280px; left: 10%; bottom: 0; background: #03dbfc; }

  @media (min-width: 901px) {
    :global(.content:has(.loomey-page)) {
      max-width: 1280px;
      padding-inline: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    }

    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(340px, 380px);
      gap: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 4rem);
      min-height: 610px;
      padding: 2.15rem 0 2.65rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 840px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 4.15rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .hero-text {
      max-width: 660px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-showcase {
      align-self: center;
      justify-self: end;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 380px;
      min-height: 430px;
    }

    .main-card {
      inset: 58px 16px 104px 16px;
      padding: 1.45rem;
      border-radius: 26px;
      transform: none;
    }

    .main-card h4 {
      max-width: 320px;
      font-size: 2.35rem;
    }

    .progress-line {
      margin: 1.2rem 0;
    }

    .showcase-stats {
      gap: .65rem .9rem;
      font-size: .9rem;
    }

    .floating-card-one {
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      max-width: 282px;
    }

    .floating-card-two {
      bottom: 16px;
      left: 0;
      max-width: 292px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 901px) and (max-width: 1160px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(320px, 340px);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.7rem;
    }

    .main-card h4 {
      font-size: 2.1rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1400px) {
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 4.75rem;
    }
  }

  .intro-section { max-width: 850px; padding: 4rem 0 2rem; }
  .intro-section h2,
  .gallery-heading h2,
  .spotlight h2,
  .details-section h2,
  .community-banner h2,
  .cta-section h2 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.05; }

  .loomey-gallery-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2rem 0 3.25rem;
  }

  .gallery-heading {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .loomey-gallery {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100%, 430px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 1rem 0 2.75rem;
    touch-action: pan-y;
  }

  .gallery-track-container {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 32px;
  }

  .gallery-track {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    will-change: transform;
    transition: transform .62s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
  }

  .gallery-slide {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: .78;
    transition: opacity .35s ease;
  }

  .gallery-slide.is-active {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .gallery-slide img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1170 / 2532;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.035);
    box-shadow:
      0 26px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.42),
      0 0 32px rgba(3,227,252,.12),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  .gallery-button {
    position: absolute;
    top: 47%;
    z-index: 4;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(0,0,0,.32), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .18s ease, background .18s ease, border-color .18s ease;
  }

  .gallery-button:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.28);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .gallery-button img {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
  }

  .gallery-button-left {
    left: .35rem;
  }

  .gallery-button-left img {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .gallery-button-right {
    right: .35rem;
  }

  .gallery-meta {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: .55rem;
    z-index: 4;
    display: grid;
    gap: .55rem;
    width: min(300px, 62%);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: .76rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .gallery-progress {
    height: 7px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

